# Initial Setup's Initial Tune Parameter page, ported from GCSViews/ConfigurationView/
# ConfigInitialParams.cs (PLAN.md §13.6 row 70).
#
# The claim: Activate puts 9 and 4 in the airscrew and cell-count boxes, clears both check boxes
# and selects LiPo (ConfigInitialParams.cs:54-69); choosing a chemistry writes its cell voltages
# into the other two boxes (:245-273); Calculate Initial Parameters reads the boxes, works out the
# parameters as calc_values does and names them for the firmware, then opens ParamCompare over the
# vehicle's table with its button renamed "Write to FC" (:124-241, Controls/paramcompare.cs); when
# that closes with OK it reports "Initial Parameters succesfully updated." and what to do after the
# test flight.
#
# Nothing is written to SITL: Check/Uncheck All clears every Use box before Write to FC, so the
# form closes with OK having set nothing, and the report shows all the same, as the C#'s does.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/config-initialparams.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen params
window 1600x1200
budget 8
# A config.xml of its own, so the "Show me again?" boxes this script clicks are not already
# suppressed by the settings of the machine running it.
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
# The vehicle first: a click before its first heartbeat is a click the screen may forget
# (vehicle.connected only says the link is open).
expect vehicle.count > 0
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

click param-download
expect params.held > 1000

click tab-setup
expect config.initialparams.active false
click setup-page-ConfigMandatory
click setup-page-ConfigInitialParams
expect setup.page ConfigInitialParams
expect config.initialparams.active true

# Activate's values.
expect config.initialparams.prop 9
expect config.initialparams.cellcount 4
expect config.initialparams.chemistry LiPo
expect config.initialparams.cellmax 4.2
expect config.initialparams.cellmin 3.3
expect config.initialparams.tmotor false
expect config.initialparams.suggested false
expect config.initialparams.compare.open false

# LiPoHV: a cell's charged voltage becomes 4.35.
click initialparams-chemistry
click initialparams-chemistry-1
expect config.initialparams.chemistry LiPoHV
expect config.initialparams.cellmax 4.35
expect config.initialparams.cellmin 3.3

click initialparams-tmotor
expect config.initialparams.tmotor true

# Calculate: ParamCompare over the vehicle's table.
click initialparams-calculate
expect config.initialparams.compare.open true

# Nothing ticked, Write to FC: the form closes with OK, the report shows.
click paramcompare-toggleall
click paramcompare-save
expect config.initialparams.compare.open false
expect config.initialparams.writes.pending 0
click initialparams-message-ok

# Choosing another page hides this one; it is IActivate only.
click setup-page-ConfigOptional
expect config.initialparams.active false
